{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31519","headline":"登蒲涧寺後二岩三首 三 · 李羣玉","name":"登蒲涧寺後二岩三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南溟吞越绝，极望碧鸿蒙。\n龙渡潮声里，雷喧雨气中。\n赵佗丘壠灭，马援鼓鼙空。\n遐想鱼鹏化，开襟九万风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}